Register the headless frontend as mode `borgh` in upstream's module table
(main.c) and declare its entry points (main.h). Guarded by USE_BORGH.

From borg-rs 286215c angband/src (main.c, main.h), its BORG_HARNESS and
USE_BORGH hunks only (docs/PROVENANCE.md). Apply with patch -p1 in the tree.

--- a/src/main.c
